<p style="padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; background: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">各位考生：</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31px; background: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: 宋体;">为方便各位考生申报大连理工大学，现开通“大连理工大学接收推荐免试攻读研究生预报名系统”，网址为https://yjszs.dlut.edu.cn/zsbm/logon，现将有关事项说明如下：</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31px; background: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px;">1.“我校接收推免生预报名系统”的申请者须为预计能够获得本科所在高校2027</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px;">年推荐免试资格的应届毕业生；</span></span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31px; background: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">2.申请者登录“我校接收推免生预报名系统”前须仔细<span style="letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">阅读</span>系统中的申请须知，并认真按照其要求完成申报；</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31px; background: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px;">3.各学部（学院）将分批次审核“我校接收推免生预报名系统”申请信息，</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-family: 仿宋;">具体时间安排及报名所需材料详见“预推免报名系统”。</span></span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31px; background: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px;">4.待国家系统正式开通后，所有推免申请者（含已参加我校推免预报名）均须在“全国推免服务系统”中申报我校。</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><strong style="color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; text-indent: 31px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">各学部（学院）推免生预报名时间安排（持续更新中）</span></strong></p><div class="tableContainer" style="width:100%;overflow-x:auto"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: 6px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; width: 859px; table-layout: fixed;"><colgroup><col data-offset-left="66.5" data-offset-right="501.015625" data-resize-pixel="434.515625" data-resize-percent="50.583891152502915" style="width: 50.5839%;"><col data-offset-left="501.015625" data-offset-right="924.5" data-resize-pixel="423.484375" data-resize-percent="49.2996944121071" style="width: 49.2997%;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="height:20px"><td valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><p style="text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(65, 65, 65);font-size: 14px">院系名称</span></strong></p></td><td valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor; background: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><p style="text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(65, 65, 65);font-size: 14px">报名时间</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:20px"><td valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(249, 249, 249);"><p style="